@host = http://localhost:5108
@softwareCode = ROAD_PROCESS
@currentVersion = 1.0.0
@updateToken = ssp_upd_请替换为管理员生成的真实Token
@versionId = 1

### 客户端检查更新
POST {{host}}/api/client-updates/check
Content-Type: application/json
X-Update-Token: {{updateToken}}

{
  "softwareCode": "{{softwareCode}}",
  "currentVersion": "{{currentVersion}}"
}

### 下载增量文件（path 必须存在于 manifest）
GET {{host}}/api/client-updates/versions/{{versionId}}/files?path=RoadProcess.exe
X-Update-Token: {{updateToken}}

### 完整安装包兜底
GET {{host}}/api/client-updates/versions/{{versionId}}/full-package
X-Update-Token: {{updateToken}}
